---
title: Roasted Pumpkin Seeds
servings: 4
time: 35 min
tags: snack, pumpkin, seeds, quick
cuisine: American
course: snack
source: roasted_pumkin_seeds.png
---

Clean @pumpkin seeds{1%cup} thoroughly, removing as much pulp and pumpkin fibers as possible.

Spread seeds out on a #cookie sheet{} and leave to dry completely (overnight is best).

Preheat oven to 300°F (150°C).

Spread seeds in a single layer on the cookie sheet and coat generously with @butter spray{} (or vegetable oil). Flip seeds and spray the other side.

Season generously with @salt{1%tsp} and arrange in an even single layer.

Bake until golden brown and crunchy, about ~seed{25%minutes}.
